  @8h  ours 4.44 | GTSM_al 8.33 | pers 6.43   [eval_gtsm.log: 4.44 | 8.33 | 6.43]
  @48h ours 6.35 | GTSM_al 8.24 | pers 11.26   [6.35 | 8.23 | 11.25]
